{
  "id": "JHN.8",
  "number": "8",
  "bookId": "JHN",
  "reference": "Yohana 8",
  "verseCount": 59,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dhako m'omak munyo timo cot",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "[To Yesu okidho wi got ma Oliv ayin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawere mere odikin, aka go ogik i Ot pa Were. Lwak ji gibe ocokere othoko go, to go bedo piny to cako fonjo jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo jondiko kodi Jofarisayo jokelo dhako m'omak munyo timo cot, to joketho go wocungi ruwaŋ ji je. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka jowaco ri Yesu ni, “Jafonji, dhako me owok nwaŋo munyo timo cot won. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.20.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jolevi 20:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.22.22+DEU.22.23+DEU.22.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 22:22-24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole i Cik mawan Musa owodho or ni dhako ma pameno ripo wogoyi gi telin wotho. Onyo pama, iwaco aŋo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jowaco ama ma ciko go, ŋey jowokethi kwoŋe banja. To Yesu luŋere piny to ndiko i lowo gi lwete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo jocungo kenyo aka oyido fodi jomedere gi penji pajo, Yesu oay malo to waco rijo ni, “Ere nyatoro moro je kwoŋ win ma fodi k'otimo gimarac ama wopen bolo tele kwoŋe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo go oluŋere piny kendo to ndiko i lowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo jowinjo gino joje jocako kwalok, acel acele, cako kwoŋ jomadongo. Joweyo Yesu kenyo kende, gi dhako no munyo ocungo kenyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go otiŋo waŋe malo to waco ri dheno ni, “Dhakodwoŋ, nikune jo? Ongoye ŋata thumo rin banja be?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go odwoko ni, “Ongoye, jadwoŋ.” Yesu odwoko ni, “Onyo abende ak'othum rin banja. Onyo kadhi rin, to ikiri doko itimi reco.”]",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu a lero ma piny",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.5.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 5:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.9.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 9:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu odoko oluwo gi jo ni, “Abedo lero ma piny; ŋata luwan bino bedo gi lero ma kelo kwo aka k'owothi i mudho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jofarisayo jowaco rigo ni, “Kole onyo eno iluwo yuthenge perin iwon; kere gim'iwaco onyo k'obedo adieri.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu odwoko ni, “Be, kad'awon aluwi yuthenge paran je fodi gim'awaco otire, rupiri aŋeyo kam'awok'iye kodi kam'akidh'iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Withumo ri ji banja gi rieko ma nyadhano; to an akithum ri nyatoro banja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To kada bedi athum banja ri nyatoro, je di thumo paran obedo mar'adieri, rupiri akinitie kendan i gime; Baba m'ooran nitie kodan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.19.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 19:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ondiki i Cik mewin ni ka jokony ario joyere i wac moro, gima jowaco bedo adieri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aridho adieri ma mako kwoŋan won, aka Baba m'ooran bende ridho adieri ma mako kwoŋan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jopenjo go ni, “Benin nikune?” Yesu odwoko ni, “Wikuya an kosa Baba. Bedi wiŋeyan di wiŋeyo kiri Baba bende.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu owaco gime je munyo fonjo i Ot pa Were, dho tielo kam'ikan'iye lim. Aka ongoye ŋat'omako go rupiri ndir pere oyido fodi k'otundo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wikinyal kidho kam'akidh'iye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu owaco rijo kendo ni, “Abino kadho ran; aka wibino rangan, to wilatho i reco mewin. Kam'akidh'iye wikinyal tundo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Joyuda jowaco ni, “Ka go waco ni wakinyali kidho kama go kidh'iye, dwoŋ mere nike go ladere wotho?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu odwoko ni, “Win wicakere i piny, to an awok malo. Win ji ma piny ka, to an a ki dhano ma piny ka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo awaco riwin nike wibino tho i reco mewin. Aka wibino tho i reco mewin rupiri wikiyey nike, ‘An ago ma atuco riwin.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo jopenjo ni, “In a ŋa?” Ana Yesu ni, “Gim'atieko waco riwin wok con. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gigipiny dit m'aripo waco riwin odoko wac thoth m'aripo kelo kwoŋ win. To ŋat'ooran, obedo jar'adieri, aka awaco ri piny gim'awinjo wok bonge.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jok'onyalo niaŋ nike go oyido luwo rijo kwoŋ Bamere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo Yesu owaco rijo ni, “Ka witieko ŋawo malo Wod Dhano nyaka wibino ŋeyo ni, ‘An ago.’ Wibino ŋeyo nike akitim gimoro gi wi tungan, t'awaco gima Baba ama ofonjan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka ŋat'ooran nikodan, k'oweyan kendan, rupiri ndir je atimo gima sangala go.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jomathoth ma jowinjo Yesu munyo waco gigipiny me joyeyo go.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Joma ni siem kodi jom'obedo ŋecin",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo Yesu owaco ri Joyuda ma joyeyo go ni, “Ka wiwinjo fonji paran to wicwir'iye meno wijofonjirok paran adieri; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wibino ŋeyo adieri, aka adieri no bino miyo wibedo i siem.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jodwoko ni, “Kole wabedo nyikway Abraham, kendo fodi wakibedo ŋecin pa nyatoro, odoko iwaco nedi n'ibino loko wan joma ni siem?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu owaco rijo ni, “Adieri awaco riwin, moro je ma timo gimarac meno ŋeca pa gimarac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndiri je ŋeca kibedi japeco; to nyathi anywola ama ndir je bedo japeco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Wod Were omiyo win siem, wibino bedo joma ni siem adieri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋeyo nike wibedo nyikway Abraham. To kad'ameno je fodi wirango nekan, rupiri wikiyey jolo fonji paran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluwo kwoŋ gima Baba onyuthan, to win witimo gima bawin owaco riwin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo jodwoko go ni, “Bawan obedo Abraham.” Yesu odwoko ni, “Bedi adieri winyithindho pa Abraham, di witimo gima cango go otimo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To an ma awaco riwin adieri ma awinjo bongi Were, ama je fodi wimito nekan. Kole Abraham k'otimo gima cale ameno! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adieri witimo gima bawin otimo.” Jodwoko ni, “Wakibedo nyithindho madudi. Wanitie gi Bawan acel kende, Were won gipi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu owaco rijo ni, “Bedi Were a Bawin adieri, di wimaran, rupiri awok bongi Were aka onyo an ka. Akibino gi wi tungan, to go ama ooran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To raŋo ma wikiniaŋ gim'awaco? Obedo rupiri wikimiti winjo fonji paran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wibedo nyithindho pa bawin, jwogi, aka wimito timo gima bawin no yenyo. Wok con go oyido janek, fodi go k'obedo yuthenge mar'adieri, rupiri adieri ongoye i go. Ka go twodo meno go timo gikula pere won, rupiri go jatwodo aka go a ba jotwodo je. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To rupiri awaco riwin gir'adieri am'omiyo wikiyeyan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋa kwoŋ win manyalo nyutho ni atimo gimarac? To k'inen awaco gir'adieri raŋo ma wikiyeyan? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋata wok bongi Were winjo wac pa Were. Gim'omiyo wikiyey winjo wac paran, obedo rupiri wikibedo apa Were.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu kodi Abraham",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joyuda jopenjo Yesu ni, “Kere wakitire munyo wawaco nike in i Jasamaria aka jwogi ni kwoŋin?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu odwoko ni, “Angoye gi jwogi moro je, aworo Baba, to win wikiworan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akirangi dwoŋ paran awon, to nitie Ŋata rango aka ama bino bedo jathum banja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adieri awaco riwin, ni ŋata winjo fonji paran kilatho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joyuda jowaco rigo ni, “Pama onyo nyaka waŋeyo odoco nike initie gi jwogi. Abraham kodi jotuci wac Were jotho, aka odoko iwaco ni, ŋata winjo fonji perin kilatho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo iwaco nike idwoŋ loyo Abraham Bawan m'otieko tho. Aka jotuci wac Were bende jotho. Iparo nike in iŋa?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu odwoko ni, “Bedi awon amiyere dwoŋ, dwoŋ paran dinyo ongoye gimoro. Ŋata miyan dwoŋ manago Baba, ma wilwoŋo ni Were mewin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole fodi wikiŋeyo kiri go, to an aŋeyo go aka awinjo wac pere. Bedi awaci ni akuya go, d'abedo jatwodo paka win. T'aŋeyo go aka awinjo wac pere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawin Abraham osangala nike oyido laneno ndelo paran; oneno aka osangala.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joyuda jowaco rigo ni, “K'inen fodi ikirom kada oro piero abic, am'iwaco ni itieko neno Abraham?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu odwoko ni, “Adieri awaco riwin, mafodi k'onywol Abraham oyido anitie.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.58"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ro meno jodimo telin ma goyo gine go to go opondo to eye i Ot pa Were.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.59"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "JHN.9",
    "number": "9",
    "bookId": "JHN"
